over:underline\",\"children\":\"Rate Your FPL Team With AI: Talk FPL With ChatGPT or Claude\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"best-fpl-defcon-defenders\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog/best-fpl-defcon-defenders\",\"className\":\"text-sm text-sky-deep hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Best FPL DEFCON Defenders 2026/27: Who to Pick and Who Was Best Last Season\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"fpl-international-break-injuries\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog/fpl-international-break-injuries\",\"className\":\"text-sm text-sky-deep hover:underline\",\"children\":\"FPL Injuries: International Duty Is No Riskier Than a Gameweek\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"fulham-fpl-team-to-watch-fixtures\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog/fulham-fpl-team-to-watch-fixtures\",\"className\":\"text-sm text-sky-deep hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Fulham: An FPL Team to Watch Before Their Two Easiest Fixtures of the Season\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"box-to-box-midfielders-defcon-attack\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog/box-to-box-midfielders-defcon-attack\",\"className\":\"text-sm text-sky-deep hover:underline\",\"children\":\"FPL DEFCON Midfielders: 16 with Attacking Returns (GW1–5)\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"how-fpl-bonus-points-work\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog/how-fpl-bonus-points-work\",\"className\":\"text-sm text-sky-deep hover:underline\",\"children\":\"How FPL Bonus Points Work: The BPS Explained (2026/27)\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"what-the-top-100-fpl-managers-did-differently\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog/what-the-top-100-fpl-managers-did-differently\",\"className\":\"text-sm text-sky-deep hover:underline\",\"children\":\"What the Top 100 FPL Managers Did Differently: The Elite Template After GW5\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"inside-the-worlds-number-1-fpl-team\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog/inside-the-worlds-number-1-fpl-team\",\"className\":\"text-sm text-sky-deep hover:unde